WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.875
Open ChinaTech in your phone or computer browser.

00:00:03.875 --> 00:00:07.750
The sign in and register links are at the top left.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.333
There is no app to download.

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose Register and enter your name, email and password twice.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.458
Your password needs at least ten characters, including letters
and numbers.

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:25.167
Open the verification email in the same browser used to
register.

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:30.917
After verification, the shop owner still needs to grant access
to shop records.

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:36.333
On the sign in page, enter your email and password, or use the
Google button.

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:41.125
Signing in with Google does not automatically grant shop
permissions.

00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:46.792
Use the left sidebar to open repair orders, retail devices or
customers.

00:00:46.792 --> 00:00:52.417
The records shown in this demonstration are fictional; your
shop has its own records.

00:00:52.417 --> 00:00:56.375
On a phone, tap the menu beside the page title.

00:00:56.375 --> 00:01:00.625
Your account and sign out option are at the bottom of the
sidebar.

00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:03.708
Sign out when using a shared device.
